7	 * @parblock
8	 * SVE port of acl_gemm: F32 GEMM (M=N=K=64) computed on SVE svmla
9	 * micro-kernels (outer-product accumulation per K-step, VL-agnostic
10	 * predicated loads) replacing the Arm Compute Library NEGEMM run path;
11	 * the golden stays the naive triple loop, computed with std::fmaf so
12	 * golden and SVE path share the identical fused single-rounding
13	 * multiply-add (the compiler fuses the SVE svmul+svadd pattern into
14	 * FMLA anyway, so an unfused double-rounding golden can never match
15	 * bit-exactly) and compare byte-exact on finite inputs (matrix entries
16	 * are filtered to finite values; NaN payload propagation is
17	 * implementation freedom, see fpu_special_values_sve). Any mismatch
18	 * indicates silent corruption in the FPU/FMA/SVE pipeline.
19	 * @endparblock
20	 */
